  ("Assessment Bias: Cultural & Linguistic Bias in Testing", "A reading comprehension test using sports terminology unique to American baseball (e.g., 'striking out', 'bunting', 'dugout') administered to rural Filipino students displays:", "Cultural/Contextual Bias (penalizing students who lack specific cultural background knowledge rather than testing reading ability).", ["High construct validity.", "Perfect psychometric reliability.", "Predictive validity."]),
